  <div class="hbg" role="img" aria-label="White water breaking beyond the harbour wall in Funchal while boats stay moored inside the marina" style="background-image:url('../assets/journal/rough-sea-beyond-funchal-harbour-wall-boats-moored-madeira.jpg');background-image:image-set(url('../assets/journal/rough-sea-beyond-funchal-harbour-wall-boats-moored-madeira.webp') type('image/webp'),url('../assets/journal/rough-sea-beyond-funchal-harbour-wall-boats-moored-madeira.jpg') type('image/jpeg'))"></div>
